 "narrative": "## The trajectory\nRevenue was $14.3B in FY2025 [1].\nRevenue CAGR was +12.8% over FY2016..FY2025 [2].\nNet income was $4.5B in FY2025 [3].\n\n## Growth quality\nRevenue growth in FY2025 was +1.0% [1] [4].\nNet income growth in FY2025 was +2.1% [3] [5].\nIn FY2025, net income growth of +2.1% [3] [5] was above revenue growth of +1.0% [1] [4].\nIn FY2025, operating cash flow growth of +12.6% [6] [7] was above net income growth of +2.1% [3] [5].\n\n## Margins\nOperating margin was 24.9% in FY2025 [8].\nOperating margin changed -3.2pp in FY2025 [8] [9].\nNet margin was 31.4% in FY2025 [10].\n\n## Cash & balance sheet\nIn FY2025, free cash flow of $4.1B [11] was below net income of $4.5B [3].\nThe current ratio was 4.13\u00d7 in FY2025 [12], above 1.00\u00d7.\nIn FY2025, operating cash flow of $5.0B [6] was above net income of $4.5B [3].\n\n## Red flags\nOperating margin compressed 5.9pp over three periods: 30.9% \u2192 28.1% \u2192 24.9%. Source operands: Operating margin 30.9% in FY2023 [13]; Operating margin 28.1% in FY2024 [9]; Operating margin 24.9% in FY2025 [8].\n\n## What to watch next\nWatch whether revenue growth in the next reporting update improves from +1.0% in FY2025 [1] [4].\nWatch how operating margin in the next reporting update compares with 24.9% in FY2025 [8].\nWatch how free cash flow in the next reporting update compares with $4.1B in FY2025 [11].",
